                        "entry_id": "73e3a99b-b058-3102-a06e-6f2f7f20f002",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Pertaining to, or having the form of, a ring; ring-shaped; in the shape of an annulus."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "not-comparable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "026f029c-e544-409a-b96f-6bc6e327798a",
                                "sense_id": "0caebf82-b3a1-3bb4-b8f2-f5be6adbc3e3",
                                "text": "annular fiber"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "73b0cf7d-01fc-47e9-a8db-61a37d7eb333",
                                "sense_id": "0caebf82-b3a1-3bb4-b8f2-f5be6adbc3e3",
                                "text": "If anybody snickers, put 'em in their place by reminding them that the annular wing is a very old aeronautical principle."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fb168019-e09f-4ff4-869e-db2f5290e367",
                                "sense_id": "0caebf82-b3a1-3bb4-b8f2-f5be6adbc3e3",
                                "text": "The capsule in both families is spherical, with a bistratose wall; the outer cell layer usually bears nodular thickenings[…]; the inner layer (of nearly equally large cells) lacks the regular semiannular or annular thickenings of most other leafy liverworts[…]"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
